mm/CMakeLists.txt: iOS platform branch — MACOSX_BUNDLE app target with
Info.plist template (new file mm/ios/Info.plist.in), OBJCXX/ARC and Darwin
warning flags extended to iOS, deps: SDL2-static + SDL2main from LUS
FetchContent + prebuilt static ogg/vorbis/opus/opusfile via
-DSOH_IOS_DEPS_PREFIX, 2ship.o2r bundled via -DSOH_O2R_PATH, app shell via
-DSOH_IOS_SHELL_DIR. Deltas vs the Ship of Harkinian port soh 0004: no espeak/
speechsynthesizer section exists in 2S2H; SDL2_net not needed
(BUILD_CROWD_CONTROL off); main() is already SDL_main upstream
(src/code/main.c:56) so SDL2main just works. __IOS__ defined PRIVATE on the
game target (LUS's is PRIVATE to itself — reference D4). URL scheme
"twoship" (URL schemes must start with a letter; "2s2h" is not a legal
scheme). Extractor assets self-bundle via the existing POST_BUILD copy to
$<TARGET_FILE_DIR> (mm/CMakeLists.txt:501-510), which lands inside the .app.

